>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >Popis aplikace<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                            <li id=\"ramanova-spektroskopie\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"ramanova-spektroskopie-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >Ramanova spektroskopie<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                    <\/ul>\n            <\/div>\n            \n            <div class=\"eael-tabs-content\">\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"popis-aplikace-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"popis-aplikace-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-7057 size-medium alignright\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/05\/0810f1e5-300x296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"296\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/05\/0810f1e5-300x296.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/05\/0810f1e5-768x758.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/05\/0810f1e5.png 936w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p><p>Ve farmaceutick\u00e9m pr\u016fmyslu jsou informace o homogenit\u011b a chemick\u00fdch vlastnostech jednotliv\u00fdch komponent l\u00e9\u010div zcela z\u00e1sadn\u00ed, a to nejen pro kontrolu kvality, ale tak\u00e9 pro vlastn\u00ed v\u00fdvoj a optimalizaci v\u00fdrobn\u00edch proces\u016f.<\/p><p>Disperzn\u00ed Ramanova spektroskopie m\u00e1 ve farmaceutick\u00e9m pr\u016fmyslu \u0159adu aplikac\u00ed d\u00edky ohromn\u00e9mu mno\u017estv\u00ed informac\u00ed, kter\u00e9 o m\u011b\u0159en\u00e9m vzorku poskytuje. Pomoc\u00ed n\u00ed je mo\u017en\u00e9 analyzovat aromatick\u00e9 slou\u010deniny, dvojn\u00e9 i trojn\u00e9 vazby, organokovov\u00e9 molekuly a \u0159adu dal\u0161\u00edch l\u00e1tek. Touto metodou lze tak\u00e9 analyzovat i jejich fyzik\u00e1ln\u00ed vlastnosti, nap\u0159\u00edklad krystalickou formu, ve kter\u00e9 se nach\u00e1zej\u00ed. Ramanova spektroskopie nav\u00edc nen\u00ed tak citliv\u00e1 na molekuly s\u00a0velk\u00fdm dip\u00f3lov\u00fdm momentem, a tak l\u00e1tky rozpu\u0161t\u011bn\u00e9 ve vod\u011b anebo ty, kter\u00e9 vodu obsahuj\u00ed, mohou b\u00fdt m\u011b\u0159eny p\u0159\u00edmo bez jak\u00e9koli \u00fapravy.<\/p><h3>Chemick\u00e9 mapov\u00e1n\u00ed<\/h3><p>N\u011bkdy nesta\u010d\u00ed prost\u011b identifikovat danou l\u00e1tku, ale je t\u0159eba tak\u00e9 zjistit jej\u00ed rozlo\u017een\u00ed ve vyroben\u00e9 tablet\u011b. To je mimo jin\u00e9 d\u016fle\u017eit\u00e9 i pro stanoven\u00ed efektivity homogenizace b\u011bhem v\u00fdroby, ur\u010den\u00ed pravd\u011bpodobnosti vzniku aglomer\u00e1t\u016f a sledov\u00e1n\u00ed migrace jednotliv\u00fdch komponent b\u011bhem st\u00e1rnut\u00ed tablety.<\/p><p>Raman\u016fv mikroskop <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/dxr3xi-mikroskop\/\">DXR3xi<\/a> je navr\u017een\u00fd pr\u00e1v\u011b tak, aby umo\u017e\u0148oval komplexn\u00ed n\u00e1hled do mikrosv\u011bta: rychle a spolehliv\u011b. K\u00a0tomu mu dopom\u00e1h\u00e1 program OMNICxi a nejmodern\u011bj\u0161\u00ed vysokorychlostn\u00ed mikroskopick\u00fd stolek synchronizovan\u00fd s\u00a0vysoce citliv\u00fdm EMCCD detektorem. D\u00edky <a href=\"https:\/\/www.thermofisher.com\/order\/catalog\/product\/IQLAADGABFFAHCMBDI#\/IQLAADGABFFAHCMBDI\">\u0161pi\u010dkov\u00fdm m\u011b\u0159ic\u00edm parametr\u016fm<\/a> tak m\u016f\u017eete zmapovat povrch jedn\u00e9 tablety u\u017e b\u011b